```

If I change `_unwrapped_call` to:

```python
    @cached_property
    def _unwrapped_call(self) -> Any:
        if self.call is None:
            return self.call  # pragma: no cover
        call = inspect.unwrap(self.call)
        while isinstance(call, functools.partial):
            call = call.func
        return call
```

Then `is_gen_callable`, `is_async_gen_callable`, and `is_coroutine_callable` will all work for `partial` objects because they will be operating on the underlying function.

